# Scenario 'settings_redirect': モバイルせってい -> パスワードの変更 against a CGI server that answers the POST with a redirect (`net cgi=STATUS/-/-/-/-/LOCATION`, the
# sixth field is a Location: header added in round 2). Attempts (power cycle each): 302 with an absolute non-CGI URL, 301 with a host-relative "/cgb/other", 302 with the
# relative "other.txt", 302 with "again.cgi" (the redirect target is a CGI again: a redirect chain until the retry limit), 303 and 307 with an absolute URL. The password
# flow follows the redirect with 67:PasswordChange_FollowRedirect / HttpRedirect_ResolveUrl (absolute, host-relative, path-relative joins, NormalizePath).
# Round 1 ('settings_cgi') never sent a Location header. Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile' (password aZ01). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# --- attempt r302abs: cgi=302/-/-/-/-/http://gameboy.datacenter.ne.jp/cgb/other
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
net cgi=302/-/-/-/-/http://gameboy.datacenter.ne.jp/cgb/other
# --- 1. change password
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot pw_change_explain
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot pw_current_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_new_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x2
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_new_confirm
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x2
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_change_confirm_dial
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 900
shot r302abs_pw_change
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 90
shot cgb_empty_menu
